{"id":"u-e81b897e-161c-4a10-93b2-a27870180d21","src":"community","title":"SAMSON Upper Lower","author":"Brad T.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/DfgVQl-tomasovic-ul","desc":"Main Focus:\n- Building back and shoulder mass while maintaining other main movers.\n- Using repeatable and stable movements for arms to scale growth\n- A flexible last phase depending on strength or hypertrophic work\n\nDetails\n- Inspired by Alex Bromley's Bullmastiff's primary/secondary exercise selection. The main movements are OHP, RDL, and BB Row. Secondary movements are dips and pulldown variations. Each back/lower day has a short and intense hack squat session to maintain quads. \n\n- This program has 4 phases: starting, increase in volume, strength building, and a reset to start. If you run this program in cycles, use the last three weeks as a volume or strength peak, depending on goals. Use double progression for main movements. \n\n- Intensity recommendations are first set in the beginning 2 phases to be 8-9, with following sets to be 6-7.  Secondary movements are not compound and should be trained to mechanical/technical failure. Train arms and tertiary movements to failure.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":50,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T03:37:01.307Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Shoulders+Chest","Back+Legs","Shoulders+Chest","Back+Legs"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Overhead Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8},{"lo":10,"hi":12}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"JM Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Abs Crunch (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10},{"lo":10,"hi":12}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":8},{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":2}],"note":"Main Lift"},{"n":"Leg Cur